"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5qVG7T82jRnKGR9O7_0cFw","review_id":"ooW4P-jIgv2wJVtwXE_TVA","date":"2017-11-02T02:43:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9313600063323975,"text_excerpt":"This was my go-to Starbucks when I was in New Orleans recently for a business trip. The first thing I noticed was the cool, local theme that the place was decorated in. It looked a bit old timey, kind of like an old store and hanging from the ceiling were musical instruments. I really liked this. This is a pretty busy Starbucks due to its location on Canal St., close to the French Quarter. The line moves quick, though. On my last day, they were out of almond and soy milk so not sure if they didn't get a shipment or what. They did make it up to me by giving me a very, very large chai latte since my only choice was 2% milk."},{"business_id":"5qVG7T82jRnKGR9O7_0cFw","review_id":"6x_sxtLshqKRLJAk5LVWfw","date":"2018-03-17T16:13:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.925860583782196,"text_excerpt":"This is the Starbucks at 700 Canal Street at St. Charles Avenue. It is a reserve store and pretty basic for a Starbucks. The coffee and other beverages are delicious and a decent size. The staff and baristas are amazing. The shop is pretty spacious. It is in the heart of the tourist district so there are times when it is very busy. Especially on the weekend and when events and conventions are in town. There is a code to use the facilities but once you make a purchase the baristas are happy to give it to you. The food is decent for a quick snack or grab and go. The menu isn't extensive but there's something to love. This is the Starbucks I regularly come to. It's the closest one to my home..."},{"business_id":"5qVG7T82jRnKGR9O7_0cFw","review_id":"bscFXcM1yNOePbHBgseM9g","date":"2017-01-21T20:02:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9230368733406067,"text_excerpt":"I heart EVERYTHING about this Starbucks. From the location (perfect for lookey-lous) to the friendly staff to the quick drink processing - to the busyness to the hustle & bustle of it all. They handle the load with finesse, grace & class. Due to the location of this Starbucks, I'm surprised it's not a 24-hr store, or is it??? I'm sure in NYC there's a 24-hr starbucks or even Cali. Anywho, I digress; but yeah back to this location... My hope is that once you make it here to this location, that you're not dismayed by the parking situation. It can be a bit overwhelming, but the treats that await you inside promise not to disappoint. #WindowseatsaretheBEST"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5qVG7T82jRnKGR9O7_0cFw","photo_id":"JVZN2yVqJbH9CMSCauLIxQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/JVZN2yVqJbH9CMSCauLIxQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.900065004825592},{"business_id":"5qVG7T82jRnKGR9O7_0cFw","photo_id":"jDACQ_xpIDPzfZDbPEpw6Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jDACQ_xpIDPzfZDbPEpw6Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8945995569229126},{"business_id":"5qVG7T82jRnKGR9O7_0cFw","photo_id":"_AIdQXN_W_AcMoE64RgCkQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_AIdQXN_W_AcMoE64RgCkQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8392891883850098},{"business_id":"5qVG7T82jRnKGR9O7_0cFw","photo_id":"Akk9E-G6L4sggN-ik8ZP0w","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Akk9E-G6L4sggN-ik8ZP0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8099600076675415},{"business_id":"5qVG7T82jRnKGR9O7_0cFw","photo_id":"tYFr2UIPV1mHHKBJ2ydX9Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tYFr2UIPV1mHHKBJ2ydX9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7980912923812866}]},"notebook_case":null}
